.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

.env
.env.*

# Assistant tooling, not project configuration. launch.json describes how to
# start dev servers for a Claude Code session and settings.local.json holds
# per-machine permissions; nothing in npm, the plugin, UXP, or CI reads either.
#
# Written as `.claude/*` rather than `.claude/` on purpose: git will not descend
# into an excluded directory, so a negation below can only re-include something
# if the directory itself was never excluded.
.claude/*

# Agent definitions are the exception. They encode project knowledge -- the
# 12 GB hardware ceiling, the preset registry contract, what a workflow costs to
# adopt -- that belongs to the repo rather than to one machine, and that anyone
# continuing this project should get automatically.
!.claude/agents/
